Hello, everyone, and welcome back to our English Learning Podcast.

1060
00:42:21,220 --> 00:42:22,380
I'm Leo.

1061
00:42:22,380 --> 00:42:23,380
And I'm Tina.

1062
00:42:23,380 --> 00:42:27,740
We're here to help you speak English naturally and confidently at work.

1063
00:42:27,740 --> 00:42:33,380
Today's topic is how to talk with co-workers in English, and we're going to go much deeper

1064
